+	 * warns "GLimp_Init reached under the Vulkan backend" and returns false —
+	 * so R_InitOpenGL retries once and then calls
+	 * common->FatalError( "Unable to initialize OpenGL" ). The process dies,
+	 * from the console command that is supposed to REstart the renderer. That
+	 * file's own comment says "R_InitOpenGL and the GL vid-restart flow stay
+	 * compiled but unreachable under the Vulkan seam"; this path is how they
+	 * are reachable.
