+	 * The PARTIAL flow is implemented there (GLimp_SetScreenParms ->
+	 * ApplyScreenParms + VK_Device_RecreateSwapchain), and it does everything a
+	 * restart means for a module renderer: the device re-applies the window
+	 * parameters and rebuilds the swapchain, and the common tail below still
+	 * bumps videoRestartCount and regenerates the world. So a module renderer
+	 * takes it, loudly, instead of taking a flow that cannot work.
+	 *
